Round 1 found and the fixes landed (see the merge commits "review round 1" and the worker commits bfab6f3 macOS cloud, 8c832cf macOS Parakeet, ac5afaf Windows cloud, 1245a08 Windows Parakeet, 969328b test):
- F1 truncated formatter replies (stop_reason / finishReason / blockReason) deliver the plain transcript; max_tokens = clamp(2 x len + 256, 512, 8192).
- F2 guard: 60% word overlap for outputs of 5+ words, reject <vocabulary> / </dictation> echoes, curly-apostrophe preambles, leading-filler exemption.
- F3 CJK/Thai etc. short gate by characters. F4 timeouts logged as timeout. F5 logs carry only provider/model/status/reason; user-facing bodies redacted by key value then pattern, before truncation.
- F6 Gemini transcription blocked/cut off is a provider failure (audio kept for Retry). F7 removing the formatter's key sets formatting Off. F8 README privacy text.
- macOS: "Run setup again" snapshots and restores voiceModelID exactly; FirstRunGate understands every voice model; pending "download then switch" survives leaving Settings; redaction by value; Parakeet file work off the main actor, ordered pins, file sizes in the completion marker.
- Windows: new keys refused (not plaintext) when encryption is unavailable; Parakeet errors carry provider Parakeet and never read as offline; removing one Parakeet version keeps a transcription on the other running; notices shipped and an About row opens them; the Parakeet download e2e is stubbed.

